              "text": "ಸಮಾಧಿ — samādhi — \"a tomb; a grave\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಳೆಯ ರಾಜನ ಸಮಾಧಿ ಬೆಟ್ಟದ ಕೆಳಗೆ ಇದೆ. haḷeya rājana samādhi beṭṭada keḷage ide. The old king's tomb is below the hill."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಸಮಾಧಿಗಳು, samādhigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In religion ಸಮಾಧಿ (samādhi) is also deep meditation."
            }
          ]
        },
