          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಮಾಧಿ (samādhi) is borrowed from Sanskrit samādhi, \"putting together, joining\", with later senses that include deep meditation and a tomb (Monier-Williams)."
