              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ಮರಿಸು — smarisu — \"to commemorate; to remember\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರತಿ ವರ್ಷ ಊರಿನವರು ಆ ಯೋಧರನ್ನು ಸ್ಮರಿಸುತ್ತಾರೆ. prati varṣa ūrinavaru ā yōdharannu smarisuttāre. Every year the townspeople commemorate those warriors."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಸ್ಮರಿಸಿದೆ, smariside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Who is remembered takes -ಅನ್ನು. A formal word; in talk, ನೆನಪಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ಮರಿಸು (smarisu) is built on Sanskrit smaraṇa, \"remembering, memory\" (CDIAL 13862), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
