            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An excavation? (ಉತ್ಖನನ, utkhanana.) Archaeology? (ಪುರಾತತ್ವ, purātatva.) Ruins? (ಅವಶೇಷ, avaśēṣa.) An inscription? (ಶಾಸನ, śāsana.) A manuscript? (ಹಸ್ತಪ್ರತಿ, hastaprati.) Folklore? (ಜಾನಪದ, jānapada.) A vassal king? (ಸಾಮಂತ, sāmanta.) A battle? (ಸಮರ, samara.) A ballad? (ಲಾವಣಿ, lāvaṇi.) A moral? (ನೀತಿ, nīti.) To swindle? (ವಂಚಿಸು, vañcisu.) Confidential? (ಗೌಪ್ಯ, gaupya.) To cover up? (ಮುಚ್ಚಿಡು, mucciḍu.) To reveal? (ಬಹಿರಂಗಪಡಿಸು, bahiraṅgapaḍisu.) A plot? (ಸಂಚು, sañcu.) A hearing? (ವಿಚಾರಣೆ, vicāraṇe.) A lawsuit? (ಮೊಕದ್ದಮೆ, mokaddame.) A case? (ಪ್ರಕರಣ, prakaraṇa.) Bail? (ಜಾಮೀನು, jāmīnu.) To confess? (ತಪ್ಪೊಪ್ಪಿಕೊ, tappoppiko.) A public festival? (ಉತ್ಸವ, utsava.) A procession? (ಮೆರವಣಿಗೆ, meravaṇige.) A slogan? (ಘೋಷವಾಕ್ಯ, ghōṣavākya.) To parade? (ಮೆರೆಸು, meresu.) A flag? (ಧ್ವಜ, dhvaja.) To hunt? (ಬೇಟೆಯಾಡು, bēṭeyāḍu.) To wander? (ಅಲೆದಾಡು, aledāḍu.) To lie in wait? (ಹೊಂಚು ಹಾಕು, hoñcu hāku.) To barge in? (ನುಗ್ಗು, nuggu.) To snap? (ಮುರಿ, muri.) A memorial? (ಸ್ಮಾರಕ, smāraka.) A tomb? (ಸಮಾಧಿ, samādhi.) To commemorate? (ಸ್ಮರಿಸು, smarisu.) A bastion? (ಬುರುಜು, buruju.) To bury? (ಹೂಳು, hūḷu.)"
